<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PNC target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PNC target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Josephthal Lyon &amp; Ross analyst Frank Barkocy said he raised his price target on PNC Bank Corp to a $38-$40/shr range</p>
<p>-- Analyst says PNC Q3 reported Thursday &quot;demonstrated to investors that its strategies to enhance shareholder value are working</p>
<p>-- Analyst estimates earnings of $2.95/shr for 1996 excluding SAIF charges, and $3.25 for 1997</p>
<p>-- PNC up 1/2 to 34-1/2 in early trading</p>
</text>
